Subject: [PATCH] test(cli): --acp honors --data-dir and runs the local backend
 (red first)

Test-only commit for fork patch 0006.

- resolveAcpSandbox: --data-dir (or CLINE_SANDBOX=1 with
  CLINE_SANDBOX_DATA_DIR) points CLINE_DATA_DIR, CLINE_PROVIDER_SETTINGS_PATH
  and the session dir into the data dir and selects the local backend; with
  neither, the environment is untouched.
- AcpAgent with localBackend creates its core with forceLocalBackend: true
  (no hub daemon) and builds sandbox: true; without it the default backend
  stays.

Rebased onto cli-v3.0.71 (test files taken from the rebased fork patch 0005, old number 0006).
